      "_note": "foundingDate: keyMessages and the site copy say 2007; docs/SEO-PLAN.md recorded 2008 from the old site — Bryce to confirm the incorporation year, then both files agree. sameAs here is the fallback; Site Settings > Official profiles wins when set."
